{
    "background_story": "Ishaan was a skilled watchmaker who spent most of his days tinkering with intricate timepieces. His fascination with the mechanics of clocks and watches began when he was a child, watching his grandfather repair antique timekeepers. As he honed his craft, Ishaan developed a particular interest in designing and building custom wristwatches. His attention to detail and creativity earned him a reputation among collectors and connoisseurs. One of his most notable creations was a wristwatch with a unique, hand-engraved mechanism that told not only the time but also the phases of the moon. Ishaan's passion for horology was evident in every piece he crafted, each one a testament to his dedication to the art of watchmaking.",
